Scope of change
---------------
- Rewrote notification feature to call the real backend contract:
  GET /api/notifications/me, PATCH /api/notifications/{id}/read,
  PATCH /api/notifications/me/read-all, GET /api/notifications/socket-ticket.
- Socket.IO now authenticates with auth: { ticket } (fresh ticket per connect
  attempt); removed the legacy auth.token fallback.
- Realtime notification:new events are merged into the TanStack Query cache
  (dedupe by id, then eventId; unreadCount bumped only on feed page 1 and only
  for unread notifications).
- Added NotificationBell (mounted in MainLayout), NotificationCenter,
  NotificationList; NotificationsPage is now a thin page.
- Deleted src/features/notification/services/notificationService.ts (legacy routes).
- Tests: tests/notification.test.ts (node:test, rewritten) +
  src/test/notification-center.test.tsx (vitest, 4 UI states + unknown type).

